"""Source register data for the BigBoxPizza project.

Every source is a dict with the fields required by the brief (section 3.3).
`build_source_register.py` turns this list into BigBoxPizza_Source_Register.csv
and `build_model.py` copies it into the "Source Register" worksheet.

ACCESS METHOD NOTE: in this research session the environment's network policy
blocked direct HTTP retrieval of every research host (hts.usitc.gov, ecfr.gov,
federalregister.gov, cbp.gov, rulings.cbp.gov, api.census.gov, cbe.org.eg,
nilecarton.com, ...), and the page-fetch tool could not resolve any host.
Sources were therefore read through the web-search tool's extracts of the
pages ("search extract"), not by opening the page directly. Confidence
levels below reflect this. Any value marked for verification must be checked
against the live official page before a shipment decision.
"""

